{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是没想明白，却不愿再把日子耗在等答案上，先接下眼前能做的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"眼前能做的事\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心被失落压垮，动起来后有了些底气，也为自己还能往前而骄傲，却仍不知道最后会怎样。\",\n      \"key\": \"有了些底气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍惦记着那些珍惜的东西，却已不能像从前那样拥有，眼下承担的事也顾不上它们。\",\n      \"key\": \"顾不上它们\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕一承认难过就撑不住，只好一遍遍告诉自己没事，越说越难信，越逼自己往前越喘不过气。\",\n      \"key\": \"越说越难信\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R5\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再无限等待、先承担能做的事；改成他当下不愿继续耗着的具体选择，不把它写成行动原则。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R6\", \"R7\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动带来的底气、短暂骄傲和结果仍无把握，删去重复的主体性格言，并让昂扬中带着不甘心被失落压垮的劲。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R10\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的“小块心”改成仍惦记却不能照旧拥有的珍惜之物，说明行动为何顾不上它们，也保留这份牵挂后来变成另一种要求、最终显出生活向往的心理连续性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R8\", \"R9\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S02-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"删改\",\n      \"why\": \"珠子不支持投入本身带来快乐或不再自我审视；改成害怕承认难过、反复自我说服却越来越难信的过程，解释段内起落与焦灼。因此，原先R8不能再作为后段R11的因果依据。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aba09a36-efc1-45c1-a4af-d00e2970fc32", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T060235603685Z", "elapsed_seconds": 460.672, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:10:16.288223+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9e2f025cd9749e372d6f344eca10db55d32e2699b672a205572486708b50e1f0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T060235603685Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5a005811d255fc6f4685d0eeb0fecf0fd029b8f8c7c531768d95c162f1afa476"}}}
